<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Semapa doubles net profit.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Semapa doubles net profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending Dec 31</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		3.67    vs   1.77</p>
<p>    Proposed dividend 140 esc/shr vs   70 esc/shr</p>
<p>    Sales 64.6 vs 56.852</p>
<p>    Cash-flow 11.247 vs 10.778</p>
<p>NOTE: Semapa-Sociedade de Investimento e Gestao, SGPS is a Portuguese cement company. The expansion of construction activity boosted demand for cement in the domestic market in 1996, Semapa said in a statement.</p>
</text>
